        "original_id": "0bba28b8-301f-5c70-9429-5203edcf0972",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chino Moreno, Stephen Carpenter, Abe Cunningham, Dominic Garcia\n- Organizations: Deftones, Maverick Records\n- Places: Sacramento, California, United States\n- Products: Adrenaline\n- Concepts: alternative metal, \"the Radiohead of metal\"\n\nFacts:\n- Deftones is an American alternative metal band from Sacramento, California, United States.\n- Deftones was formed in 1988 by Chino Moreno, Stephen Carpenter, Abe Cunningham, and Dominic Garcia.\n- Chino Moreno was Deftones' lead vocalist and rhythm guitarist, Stephen Carpenter was lead guitarist, Abe Cunningham was drummer, and Dominic Garcia was bassist.\n- Adrenaline is the debut studio album by Deftones.\n- Adrenaline was released in 1995 by Maverick Records.\n- Critics have sometimes dubbed Deftones \"the Radiohead of metal.\"",
